            <article class="catalog-card" data-category="compliance"><div class="catalog-cover cover-indigo"><span>REQUIRED</span><div class="cover-symbol">✦</div><small>SAFETY & COMPLIANCE</small></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="category-label">Compliance</span><span>4.9 <i>★</i></span></div><h3>Workplace Safety Essentials</h3><p>Build a safer workplace with essential practices and procedures.</p><div class="catalog-card-foot"><span>8 lessons · 2.5 hours</span><button class="button button-outline button-small enroll-button" data-course="Workplace Safety Essentials">Assign course</button></div></div></article>
