            <article class="catalog-card" data-category="leadership"><div class="catalog-cover cover-orange"><span>POPULAR</span><div class="cover-symbol">✷</div><small>PEOPLE & CULTURE</small></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="category-label">Leadership</span><span>4.7 <i>★</i></span></div><h3>Leadership Foundations</h3><p>Practical tools to lead with clarity, trust, and confidence.</p><div class="catalog-card-foot"><span>10 lessons · 4 hours</span><button class="button button-outline button-small enroll-button" data-course="Leadership Foundations">Assign course</button></div></div></article>
            <article class="catalog-card" data-category="professional"><div class="catalog-cover cover-blue"><span>NEW</span><div class="cover-symbol">◈</div><small>CYBERSECURITY</small></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="category-label">Professional growth</span><span>4.8 <i>★</i></span></div><h3>Cybersecurity at Work</h3><p>Stay alert to digital threats and keep company data protected.</p><div class="catalog-card-foot"><span>7 lessons · 2 hours</span><button class="button button-outline button-small enroll-button" data-course="Cybersecurity at Work">Assign course</button></div></div></article>
            <article class="catalog-card" data-category="professional"><div class="catalog-cover cover-plum"><span>ON DEMAND</span><div class="cover-symbol">◎</div><small>WELLBEING</small></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="category-label">Professional growth</span><span>4.6 <i>★</i></span></div><h3>Resilience & Wellbeing</h3><p>Simple, evidence-based ways to support wellbeing at work.</p><div class="catalog-card-foot"><span>5 lessons · 1 hour</span><button class="button button-outline button-small enroll-button" data-course="Resilience & Wellbeing">Assign course</button></div></div></article>
